      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“不要说这种话”、\n“不要就这样断定没有意义啊”、\n“不要还没战斗就接受现实”之类的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe99708e62684df40766e67384a35eba71f4310323aec2c6bf9da05b3f60b7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
